# angliamorocco.org -> AGI website (301). Install on the angliamorocco.org host (Apache .htaccess), or recreate in its DNS/hosting panel.
RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^ar/?$ https://www.americangroup-international.com/ar/anglia.html [R=301,L]
